Analysis on Construction Technology of Soil Pressure Balanced Shield in Lake Tunnel
CHEN Junjun
(Wuhan Hanyang Municipal Construction Group Co., Ltd., Wuhan 430000,China)
Abstract: [Purposes] With the rapid development and utilization of underground space resources, tunnel
projects under different geological conditions are gradually increasing,thus it is necessary to study the con⁃
struction technology. [Methods] Taking a subway tunnel at the bottom of a lake as the research object, this
paper adopts the soil pressure balance shield for construction after combining with the geological condi⁃
tions and related engineering experience, and analyzes and discusses the risks encountered in the tunnel
construction and the solutions. [Findings] The results show that for this kind of special geological environ⁃
ment, using improved tearing knife instead of conventional cutter head and taking reasonable waterproof
measures can improve the construction efficiency by 30%. [Conclusions] This study has a certain refer⁃
ence significance for the green construction and intelligent construction of similar lake tunnel construction.
Keywords: tunnel; down to the bottom of the lake; shield method; construction risk; green construction
